==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
From {{der|nb|da|øje}}, replaced native {{m|nb|aue}}, from {{der|nb|gmq-oda|øghæ}}, from {{der|nb|non|auga}}, from {{der|nb|gem-pro|*augô}}, ultimately from {{der|nb|ine-pro|*h₃ekʷ-||eye; to see}}. Cognate with {{cog|nn|auga}}, {{m|nn|auge}}, {{cog|is|auga}}, {{cog|fo|eyga}} and {{cog|sv|öga}}.

===Noun===
{{head|nb|noun|g=n|definite singular|øyet|indefinite plural|øyne|or|øyer|definite plural|øynene|or|øyene|or|øya}}

